  {
    "id": "im-2855147962297",
    "name": "ABB VFD ACS560-01-088A-4, 3 - Phase, 45KW",
    "partNumber": "ACS560-01-088A-4",
    "brand": "ABB",
    "category": "Abb VFD",
    "type": "VFD",
    "description": "ACS560-01-088A-4 Ac Drives ACS560 is simple to select, easy to commission and use. Its energy-saving easy-to-use features, and environmentally friendly specifications make it an apt solution for wide range of industrial applications. As part of ABBs all-compatible drives portfolio, the ACS560 is designed to offer not only a technically compatible product, but also an all-compatible solution for your workforce, process, business and any environmental goals that you may have. The ACS560 is plug-in ready to control your pumps, fans, mixers and many other variable and basic constant torque applications. ACS560 uses protective coated circuit boards and individual air cooling lanes, all 3 phase current measurement to help ensure highest performance, high reliability and a long lifetime. ACS560 designed to work up to +55 deg C ambient conditions. The ACS560 general purpose drive is compliant with IEC standards. The integrated features such as EMC filters and brake chopper leads to reduction in needed space. ABB ensures that each and every drive produced is tested thoroughly with various test procedures by in-house as well through external certifications. The routine test procedures are stringent and always one step ahead to ensure reliable operation and long life",
    "specifications": [
      {
