    "category": "Allen Bradley VFD",
    "type": "VFD",
    "description": "The 22F-A2P5N103 is a compact, cost-effective, adjustable frequency AC drive from Allen-Bradley:  \n\n\nFeatures\n\n\nPower ratings\n0.2&ndash;11 kW (0.25&ndash;15 HP)\n\n\nVoltage classes\n120, 240, and 480 volts\n\n\nInput voltage\n200&ndash;240 VAC, 1-Phase, 2.7 Amperes\n\n\nOutput voltage\n0&ndash;230 VAC, 3-Phase, 2.5 Amperes and 0.5 HP or 0.4 kW\n\n\nFrame sizes\nA, B, and C\n\n\nIP rating\nIP20\n\n\nStandards and certifications\nCE, UL, and EAC\n\n\nOperating efficiency\n97.5%\n\n\nOutput channels\n1 Form C Relay, 1 0&ndash;10 VDC, 1 4&ndash;20 mA, and 5 discrete 24 VDC inputs\n\n\nConfiguration and programming\nIntegral LCD keypad, remote keypad, or software\n\n\nMounting\nDIN rail mounting feature on A and B frame drives\n\n\nThe 22F-A2P5N103 is suitable for machine level control and has a customizable output frequency of 0&ndash;400 Hz. It also features drive overload protection, ramp regulation, and integral RS-485 communications.",
