    "description": "&ndash; Omron E6B2-CWZ6C 1000P/R 2M Rotary Encoder\nOmron E6B2-CWZ6C 1000P/R 2M is a high-performance incremental rotary encoder designed for accurate speed, position, and motion control in industrial automation applications. Featuring 1000 pulses per revolution (PPR), A/B/Z phase outputs, and NPN open-collector output, it provides reliable feedback for PLCs, VFDs, servo systems, packaging machines, sealing machines, printing machines, and conveyors. The encoder operates on 5&ndash;24 VDC and comes with a 2-meter pre-wired cable for easy installation. Its compact 40 mm body and robust construction ensure long service life and dependable performance in demanding industrial environments. (Omron)\nKey Features:\n\n\nMake: Omron\n\n\nModel: E6B2-CWZ6C 1000P/R 2M\n\n\nType: Incremental Rotary Encoder\n\n\nResolution: 1000 PPR\n\n\nOutput: NPN Open Collector\n\n\nOutput Signals: A, B, Z Phase\n\n\nSupply Voltage: 5&ndash;24 VDC\n\n\nShaft Diameter: 6 mm\n\n\nEncoder Diameter: 40 mm\n\n\nCable Length: 2 Meter\n\n\nMaximum Speed: 6000 RPM\n\n\nResponse Frequency: 100 kHz\n\n\nProtection Class: IP50 (Omron)\n\n\nApplications:\n\n\nSealing Machines\n\n\nPouch Packing Machines\n\n\nPackaging Equipment\n\n\nPrinting Machines\n\n\nLabeling Machines\n\n\nConveyor Systems\n\n\nIndustrial Automation Panels\n\n\nPLC &amp; Motion Control Systems",
