  {
    "id": "im-2854742230691",
    "name": "Omron HMI 12.1 inch HMI",
    "partNumber": "Touch Screen",
    "brand": "Omron",
    "category": "Omron HMI",
    "type": "HMI",
    "description": "NS12-TS01B-V2 Touch screen HMI, 12.1 inch, TFT, 256 colours (32,768 colours for .BMP/.JPG), 800x600 pixels, 2 x RS-232C ports, Ethernet (10/100 Base-T), 24 VDC, 60MByte memory, 24 VDC, black caseFeatures &bull; 5.7 to 12.1 inch sizes are available. &bull; A hand-held version of the NS5 is now available to perform operations at the production site. The NS-series PT's have a complete set of functions that can be used at the production site. &bull; The Smart Active Parts(SAP Library) makes it easy to connect to OMRON PLCs and components, OMRON provides a development environment that requires with no programming and no screen designing. &bull; When an error occurs in a Unit in the OMRON PLCs, the Troubleshooter SAP Library provides an easy-tounderstand explanation of the cause of the error as well as the countermeasures. &bull; Ladder Monitor come as a Standard Feature. The ladder program can be monitored onsite without a laptop! Ladder monitor lets you monitor PLC program status, search for addresses or instructions, monitor multiple I/O points, and much more. &bull; Provides the FA integrated tool package \"CX-One\" for a Screen Design Software Integrated Simulation come as a Standard Feature. The integrated simulation function simulates ladder programs and screen data simultaneously even without the actual hardware. &bull; Screens support 42 languages and the Support Software supports eight. System messages can be displayed in eight languages. &bull; Single Port Multi Access (SPMA) come as a Standard Feature. The ladder program and screen data can be transferred from a single port! &bull; Connectable PLCs and devices appear one after another. Has become connectable with the PLCs of Mitsubishi Electric Corporation and the Inverters of OMRON Corporation",
