    "description": "The Omron E3FA-DP25 is a compact photoelectric sensor from Omron's E3FA series, designed for reliable object detection in industrial automation.\n🔧 Key Description\n\n\nType: Diffuse reflective photoelectric sensor\n\n\nSensing Method: Detects objects by receiving light reflected directly from the target (no reflector needed)\n\n\nSensing Distance: Up to 250 mm (25 cm) depending on object surface\n\n\nOutput Type: PNP output (commonly used in PLC inputs)\n\n\nOperation Mode: Light-ON / Dark-ON selectable (model dependent)\n\n\nSupply Voltage: 10 to 30 V DC\n\n\nConnection: Pre-wired cable type\n\n\n⚙️ Features\n\n\nBuilt-in amplifier &ndash; no external amplifier required\n\n\nHigh visibility LED indicator for operation status\n\n\nRobust plastic housing (IP67 rated) &ndash; suitable for dusty or wet environments\n\n\nEasy alignment due to stable light beam\n\n\nCompact size &ndash; ideal for tight machine spaces\n\n\n🏭 Applications\n\n\nObject detection on conveyors\n\n\nPackaging machines\n\n\nMaterial handling systems\n\n\nCounting and positioning tasks\n\n\n✅ Advantages\n\n\nNo reflector needed (simpler installation)\n\n\nCost-effective solution for short-range sensing\n\n\nReliable performance in industrial conditions",
