    "description": "📄 Product Description\nThe Omron E3FA-RN11 is a high-performance retro-reflective photoelectric sensor designed for reliable object detection in industrial automation applications. It operates using a red LED light source and a reflector-based sensing method, ensuring accurate detection even for shiny or reflective objects with the help of MSR (Mirror Surface Rejection) technology.\nThis sensor offers a long sensing range of up to 4 meters and delivers fast response time, making it suitable for high-speed production lines. The E3FA-RN11 comes with an NPN open collector output and supports both Light-ON and Dark-ON operation modes for flexible integration with PLC and control systems.\nBuilt with a rugged M18 cylindrical housing, it provides excellent resistance against dust and water with IP67/IP69K protection, ensuring reliable performance in harsh industrial environments. Its pre-wired cable connection allows easy installation and maintenance.\nWidely used in conveyor systems, packaging machines, material handling, and counting applications, the Omron E3FA-RN11 is an ideal choice for industries requiring consistent and non-contact detection.\n🔧 Key Features\n\n\nRetro-reflective sensing with MSR technology\n\n\nSensing distance up to 4 meters\n\n\nNPN output (open collector)\n\n\nRed LED light source\n\n\nLight-ON / Dark-ON selectable\n\n\nFast response time (~0.5 ms)\n\n\nIP67/IP69K protection rating\n\n\nM18 cylindrical design\n\n\nPre-wired cable (2 meters)\n\n\n🏭 Applications\n\n\nConveyor systems\n\n\nPackaging and bottling machines\n\n\nMaterial handling systems\n\n\nIndustrial automation lines",
