    "type": "Sensor",
    "description": "🔹 Detailed Description\nThe E3FA-DP13 works on the diffuse reflection principle, where the sensor emits a light beam and detects the light reflected back from the object. It does not require a reflector, making installation simple and cost-effective. \nIt offers a sensing distance of up to 1 meter, suitable for medium-range detection in conveyors and machine automation. \n🔹 Construction &amp; Design\n\n\nBody type: Cylindrical (M18 threaded)\n\n\nHousing: ABS plastic (industrial-grade) \n\n\nConnection: Pre-wired cable (2 m)\n\n\nProtection: IP67 / IP69K (dustproof &amp; waterproof) \n\n\n👉 Designed for harsh environments like dust, oil, and washdown areas.\n🔹 Working Principle\n\n\nSensor emits red LED light (~624 nm)\n\n\nObject reflects light back\n\n\nSensor detects reflection and switches output\n\n\n👉 Simple and reliable detection without physical contact.\n🔹 Key Technical Description\n\n\nSensing distance: 1 meter\n\n\nOutput type: PNP open collector (100 mA max)\n\n\nSupply voltage: 10&ndash;30 V DC \n\n\nResponse time: &le; 0.5 ms \n\n\nOperation modes: Light-ON / Dark-ON selectable\n\n\n🔹 Functional Features\n\n\nAdjustable sensitivity (potentiometer) \n\n\nLED indicators (operation &amp; stability) \n\n\nBuilt-in protections:\n\n\nReverse polarity\n\n\nShort circuit\n\n\n\n\nGood immunity to ambient light and electrical noise \n\n\n🔹 Applications\nCommonly used in:\n\n\nConveyor systems\n\n\nPackaging machines\n\n\nBottle/carton detection\n\n\nMaterial handling\n\n\nAssembly lines\n\n\n🔹 Summary\n👉 The E3FA-DP13 is:\n\n\n1 m range diffuse sensor\n\n\nPNP output (PLC compatible)\n\n\nFast response (0.5 ms)\n\n\nRugged design (IP67/IP69K)",
