    "description": "🔹 Product Description &ndash; E3Z-D86 Photoelectric Sensor\nThe E3Z-D86 Photoelectric Sensor is a high-performance diffuse reflective sensor designed for accurate and stable object detection in industrial automation systems. It features a built-in amplifier and operates by detecting reflected light from the target, eliminating the need for an external reflector or receiver.\nWith a sensing range of up to 100 mm, this sensor ensures reliable performance for short-distance detection applications. It is equipped with a PNP output and M8 connector, making installation and wiring simple and efficient. The compact and rugged design with IP67 protection allows it to perform reliably even in harsh industrial environments. \n🔑 Key Features\n\n\nDiffuse reflective sensing (no reflector required)\n\n\nSensing distance up to 100 mm\n\n\nPNP output type\n\n\nInfrared LED light source\n\n\nLight-ON / Dark-ON selectable modes\n\n\nFast response time (~1 ms)\n\n\nM8 connector for easy wiring\n\n\nCompact and durable housing\n\n\nIP67 rated (dustproof &amp; waterproof)\n\n\nManual sensitivity adjustment\n\n\n🏭 Applications\n\n\nConveyor and material handling systems\n\n\nPackaging and labeling machines\n\n\nBottle and object detection\n\n\nAssembly line automation\n\n\nCounting and positioning systems\n\n\n⚙️ Technical Specifications\n\n\nSupply Voltage: 12&ndash;24 V DC\n\n\nOutput: PNP Open Collector\n\n\nSensing Distance: 5 mm to 100 mm\n\n\nResponse Time: 1 ms\n\n\nLight Source: Infrared LED\n\n\nConnection: M8, 4-pin connector\n\n\nHousing Material: PBT\n\n\nProtection: Reverse polarity &amp; short circuit protection",
