    "description": "📄 Product Description\nThis is a high-performance through-beam photoelectric sensor designed for accurate and long-distance object detection in industrial automation systems. It operates using a separate emitter and receiver setup, where an infrared light beam is transmitted from the emitter to the receiver, and detection occurs when the beam is interrupted by an object.\nThe sensor offers a long sensing range of up to 15 meters, making it ideal for applications requiring reliable detection over extended distances. It provides stable performance regardless of object color or surface characteristics, ensuring consistent operation in demanding environments.\nEquipped with an NPN output and fast response time, it is suitable for high-speed production lines and precise positioning applications. The device supports Light-ON and Dark-ON modes, allowing flexible integration with PLCs and control systems.\nBuilt with a compact and rugged housing, it features a high protection rating, ensuring resistance against dust and water. Its durable design makes it suitable for use in harsh industrial conditions.\nWidely used in conveyor systems, packaging machines, warehouse automation, and material handling applications, this sensor ensures reliable, non-contact detection and enhances overall system efficiency.\n🔧 Key Features\n\n\nThrough-beam sensing method (emitter + receiver)\n\n\nLong sensing range up to 15 meters\n\n\nInfrared light source\n\n\nNPN output\n\n\nFast response time\n\n\nLight-ON / Dark-ON selectable\n\n\nHigh resistance to dust and water (industrial protection)\n\n\nCompact and durable design\n\n\n📌 Short Description\n \nIf you want, I can also:\n\n\nMake SEO keywords (IndiaMART ranking)\n\n\nCreate comparison content (through-beam vs retro-reflective)\n\n\nAdd technical specification table 👍",
