    "category": "Pilz Safety Relay",
    "type": "PLC",
    "description": "PNOZ X2.8P Safety Relay is a compact and highly reliable safety monitoring device used in industrial automation systems for protecting machinery and personnel. It is specially designed for monitoring emergency stop (E-STOP) circuits, safety gates, light curtains, and safety switches, ensuring immediate shutdown of equipment during unsafe conditions.\nThis safety relay features dual-channel input monitoring with fault detection, providing enhanced safety performance and compliance with international safety standards. It offers 3 normally open (NO) safety contacts and 1 normally closed (NC) auxiliary contact, making it suitable for complex safety control applications. \nThe relay supports both single-channel and dual-channel operation with automatic or manual reset functionality. Its built-in self-monitoring system ensures that the safety function remains effective even in case of internal faults or component failure.\n🔹 Key Features\n\n\nSuitable for E-stop, safety gate &amp; light curtain monitoring\n\n\nDual-channel safety inputs with short circuit detection\n\n\n3 NO safety outputs + 1 NC auxiliary output\n\n\nWide supply voltage: 24&ndash;240V AC/DC\n\n\nAutomatic / Manual reset option\n\n\nLED indication for status monitoring\n\n\nCompact 22.5 mm DIN rail mounting design\n\n\n🔹 Applications\n\n\nIndustrial machinery safety systems\n\n\nConveyor and packaging machines\n\n\nCNC and process automation\n\n\nSafety interlocking systems\n\n\nMaterial handling equipment\n\n\n🔹 Technical Specifications\n\n\nSupply Voltage: 24&ndash;240V AC/DC\n\n\nInputs: 2-channel safety input\n\n\nOutputs: 3 NO + 1 NC\n\n\nMounting: DIN rail\n\n\nWidth: 22.5 mm\n\n\nPower Consumption: ~2W (DC) / 4.5 VA (AC) \n\n\n🔹 Summary\nPNOZ X2.8P is a robust and widely used safety relay that ensures reliable machine shutdown and operator safety by continuously monitoring critical safety circuits with high accuracy and fail-safe performance.",
