  {
    "id": "im-2859112309248",
    "name": "PNOZ X7 Safety Relay",
    "partNumber": "PNOZX7SAFETYRELAY",
    "brand": "PILZ",
    "category": "Pilz Safety Relay",
    "type": "PLC",
    "description": "PNOZ X7 Safety Relay is a compact and reliable safety monitoring device designed for industrial automation systems. It is primarily used for monitoring emergency stop (E-STOP) circuits, safety gates, and control circuits , ensuring immediate shutdown of machinery in case of hazardous conditions. This relay operates on a single-channel input system and provides fail-safe protection by interrupting the output circuit when a fault is detected. It is equipped with positive-guided relay contacts , ensuring safe and reliable switching performance in critical applications. (CPC Ireland) The PNOZ X7 features 2 normally open (NO) safety contacts , making it suitable for basic safety control applications. It supports both automatic and manual reset functions and includes LED indicators for easy status monitoring. (CPC Ireland) 🔹 Key Features Suitable for E-stop and safety circuit monitoring Single-channel safety input 2 NO safety contacts (positive-guided) Automatic / Manual reset option LED indicators for power and status Feedback loop monitoring for external contactors Compact DIN rail mounting (22.5 mm width) (RS Online) 🔹 Applications Emergency stop circuits (E-STOP) Basic machine safety systems Conveyor and packaging machines Industrial automation panels Safety gate monitoring 🔹 Technical Specifications Supply Voltage: 24V AC/DC / 110–240V AC (model dependent) Inputs: Single-channel Outputs: 2 NO safety contacts Mounting: DIN rail Width: 22.5 mm Contact rating: up to 240V AC, 4–6A (Pilz) 🔹 Working Principle (Simple) Safety device (E-stop / switch) connected to input Relay continuously monitors input signal On emergency or fault: 👉 outputs open immediately Machine stops safely 🔹 Important Note 👉 PNOZ X7 is a single-channel safety relay , so it is suitable for basic safety applications only . 👉 For higher safety (dual-channel / Cat.4), models like X2.1 or X2.8P are preferred. 🔹 Summary PNOZ X7 is a compact and cost-effective safety relay ideal for basic safety monitoring applications, offering reliable performance, simple wiring, and dependable fail-safe operation.",
