    "category": "Pilz Safety Relay",
    "type": "PLC",
    "description": "PNOZ X3 Safety Relay is a highly reliable and widely used safety monitoring device designed for industrial automation systems. It is used for monitoring emergency stop (E-STOP) circuits, safety gates, limit switches, and other safety-related control functions to ensure safe operation of machinery.\nThis safety relay provides fail-safe protection by instantly interrupting the control circuit in case of any fault or hazardous condition. It supports both single-channel and dual-channel input wiring with built-in short circuit and fault detection, ensuring high safety performance in critical applications. (Pilz)\nThe relay is equipped with 3 normally open (NO) safety contacts and 1 normally closed (NC) auxiliary contact, making it suitable for multiple control outputs. Its self-monitoring redundant circuit design ensures reliable operation even in case of internal component failure. (RS Online)\n🔹 Key Features\n\n\nSuitable for E-stop, safety gate &amp; interlock monitoring\n\n\nSingle &amp; dual-channel operation with cross-fault detection\n\n\n3 NO safety outputs + 1 NC auxiliary output\n\n\nAutomatic or monitored manual reset\n\n\nLED indicators for power and channel status\n\n\nSelf-monitoring (fail-safe) design\n\n\nStandard DIN rail mounting (RS Online)\n\n\n🔹 Applications\n\n\nIndustrial machinery safety systems\n\n\nConveyor &amp; packaging machines\n\n\nCNC and process automation\n\n\nSafety gate and door monitoring\n\n\nLight barriers / safety sensors\n\n\n🔹 Technical Specifications\n\n\nSupply Voltage: 24V DC / 24&ndash;48V AC (model dependent)\n\n\nOutputs: 3 NO + 1 NC + 1 semiconductor output\n\n\nInputs: 1 or 2 channel safety input\n\n\nMounting: DIN rail\n\n\nWidth: approx. 45 mm\n\n\nPower Consumption: ~5 VA (AC) (Pilz)\n\n\n🔹 Working Principle (Simple)\n\n\nSafety device (E-stop / switch) connected to inputs\n\n\nRelay continuously monitors input channels\n\n\nOn fault or emergency:👉 all safety contacts open immediately\n\n\nMachine is safely stopped\n\n\n🔹 Summary\nPNOZ X3 is a robust and industry-standard safety relay designed for reliable monitoring of safety circuits. Its multiple output contacts, advanced fault detection, and fail-safe operation make it ideal for protecting both machinery and personnel in industrial environments.",
